{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"DEU","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"申命记","commonName":"申命记","title":"申命记","order":5,"numberOfChapters":34,"sha256":"8bcef4291eceeae7f82fc249330b10c87bbadfbb92c93565cfd900e5b52a2379","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/DEU/1.json","lastChapterNumber":34,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/DEU/34.json","totalNumberOfVerses":949},"chapter":{"number":33,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["摩西最后的祝福"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["以下是上帝的仆人摩西临终时给以色列人的祝福："]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"text":"“耶和华从西奈山来，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"从西珥山向我们显现，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂从巴兰山发出光辉；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂带着千万圣者来临，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂右边有闪耀的光芒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂深爱自己的子民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"众圣者都听命于祂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"伏在祂的脚前，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"领受祂的训诲。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"摩西将律法颁布给我们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"作为雅各子孙的产业。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"百姓的众首领齐聚，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列各支派集合之时，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华在耶书仑做王。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"摩西祝福吕便支派说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“尽管吕便人数稀少，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"愿他存活，不致灭没。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"摩西祝福犹大支派说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“耶和华啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你听犹大人的呼求，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"带他们回归本族，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"出手为他们争战，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"帮他们对抗仇敌。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"摩西祝福利未支派说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“耶和华啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你把土明和乌陵赐给虔诚的利未人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你曾经在玛撒试验他们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在米利巴泉边与他们争论。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"为了听从你的话，遵守你的约，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们不顾父母，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"舍弃弟兄，抛下儿女。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们把你的典章传授给雅各，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"把你的律法传授给以色列；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们要把香献在你面前，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"把全牲燔祭献在你的坛上。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你赐他们力量，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"悦纳他们的工作，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"击碎仇敌的腰杆，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使敌人一蹶不振。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"摩西祝福便雅悯支派说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“耶和华所爱的人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"安居在祂身边，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"安居在祂怀中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"终日蒙祂庇护。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"text":"摩西祝福约瑟家族说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“愿他们的土地蒙耶和华赐福，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"得天上的甘霖，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"及地下的泉源；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"得日月之辉，物产丰美；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"得古老群山之精华，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"永存丘陵之富饶；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"得大地的丰肥，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"蒙荆棘火中之上帝的恩宠。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"愿这些福气落在约瑟头上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"临到弟兄中的王者身上。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"约瑟威武如头生的公牛，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有野牛的角，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他用角抵万邦，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"直到地极。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的两角是数以万计的以法莲人和数以千计的玛拿西人。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"text":"摩西祝福西布伦和以萨迦支派说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“愿西布伦人欣然外出，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"愿以萨迦人在帐篷中欢喜。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们要招聚众人上山，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"一同献上公义的祭；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们汲取海里的财富和沙中的宝藏。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"text":"摩西祝福迦得支派说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“扩张迦得疆界的那位当受称颂！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"迦得蹲伏如母狮，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"撕碎头颅和臂膀。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他为自己选了最好的土地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是留给首领的那份。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他与众首领同行，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"施行耶和华的公义和祂给以色列的典章。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"text":"摩西祝福但支派说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“但像一只从巴珊跃出的幼狮。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"text":"摩西祝福拿弗他利支派说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“拿弗他利人啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们饱尝耶和华的恩宠，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"满得祂的赐福，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"拥有西方和南方的土地。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"text":"摩西祝福亚设支派说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“愿亚设在众子中最蒙福，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"受众弟兄的恩待，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"双脚沐浴橄榄油，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"城门有铜锁铁闩，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"一生都充满力量。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":[{"text":"“耶书仑啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"上帝独一无二，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂驰骋诸天，前来助你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"穿越长空，充满威严。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"亘古的上帝是你的庇护，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂永恒的臂膀是你的依托。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂赶走你面前的仇敌，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"下令毁灭他们。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":28,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列安然居住，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雅各独居一处，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那里盛产五谷新酒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有天上的雨露滋润。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":29,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列啊，你多么有福！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"蒙耶和华拯救之人啊，谁能像你？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂是你的盾牌，你得胜的宝剑。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"敌人要向你屈服，被你践踏。”","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/DEU/33.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/DEU/34.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/DEU/32.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":29}